This solution:
- Provides a fallback crypto implementation for the browser
- Gracefully handles any potential errors that might occur
- Maintains the original functionality of the component
- Doesn't break the preview functionality

The mock crypto implementation provides a basic random number generation that should be sufficient for preview purposes. The error boundary will catch any remaining crypto-related issues and prevent the entire preview from crashing.

